(ns java.util.Arrays
  "java.util.Arrays' statics under their fully qualified name (vanilla :clj
   code calls java.util.Arrays/fill and kin directly), as a real namespace
   of real vars.

   A real module, not eve.host-completion's runtime synthesis, so jank's AOT
   compiler can analyze and collect it; see Math.jank's docstring.
   eve.host-completion requires this namespace; its when-not intern block
   remains as the fallback for any environment where this module was not
   loaded.

   The vars are the Arrays module's — the two names are one answer, as they
   are in the completion's synthesis this module replaces."
  (:require [Arrays]))

(def fill Arrays/fill)
(def copyOf Arrays/copyOf)
(def copyOfRange Arrays/copyOfRange)
(def sort Arrays/sort)
(def binarySearch Arrays/binarySearch)
